      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY MACHANE (3) turned in a strong performance last start when he battled on bravely to just miss out over 2185m at this track. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Big chance in a similar line-up. HE IS TALKING (10) finished 11th at Gloucester Park two runs ago before finishing seventh at his latest appearance over 2536m at Gloucester Park, beaten 30 metres. No favours expected from this draw. Beautifully placed and is sure to be there at the finish. MISS BEJEWELED (9) should be at her peak for this. Finished sixth over 2536m at Gloucester Park at the latest appearance a week-and-a-half ago. Sure to give the top fancies plenty to think about. MATERNAL DREAMS (2) finished sixth two runs ago then broke and finished a long last over 2662m at Narrogin at the latest appearance. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Beautifully placed and is able to make amends.",
